 DAY 6 — MASTER PROMPT ENGINEERING
## YouTube Script in Tanglish

### 00:00–00:25 — Hook

Neenga ChatGPT open panni, “Act as an expert, give me the best answer” nu type panreengala?

Adhu mattum podhaadhu!

Oru AI animation create pannanum, competitors-a analyse pannanum, proper research pannanum, illa engaging video script write pannanum-na, role kudukkaradha vida mukkiyamaana instructions irukku.

Innaikku naalu real examples-la kaatturen. Prompt type pannradhu mattum illa — output-la enna difference varudhu, adha eppadi check pannanum-nu paappom.

### 00:25–01:10 — Role prompting: the actual difference

First, role prompting.

Role kudukkaradhu useful. Aana “Act as an expert” nu sonna mattum AI-ku unga exact requirement therinjidaadhu.

Example-ku, “Act as a marketing expert” nu type panreenga.

Marketing expert enna pannanum? Social media plan-aa? Competitor research-aa? Ad campaign-aa? Sales strategy-aa?

Adhu specify pannala.

So, role-kooda task-um context-um output-um specify pannanum.

Simple formula:

Role — yaar maadhiri work pannanum?

Task — enna pannanum?

Context — endha situation-ku?

Constraints — enna limits irukku?

Output — answer eppadi venum?

Verification — result correct-aa irukka eppadi check pannradhu?

Idha oru formula maadhiri use pannalaam. Aana ella prompt-kum ella component-um thevai illa.

Ippo actual examples-ku polaam.

### 01:10–03:10 — Demo 1: AI animation

Suppose namakku oru cinematic 3D animation venum.

Weak prompt: “Create a cool futuristic city animation.”

Idhu romba vague. City eppadi irukkanum? Camera move aaganuma? Lights eppadi? Video vertical-aa horizontal-aa? Ethuvume specify pannala.

Ippo prompt-a improve pannuvom.

[SCREEN RECORDING: Paste the animation master prompt and fill in the scene details.]

Namma role-a animation director-nu define panrom. Scene-la enna irukku, enna action nadakkanum, camera eppadi move aaganum, lighting eppadi irukkanum, duration evlo, aspect ratio enna-nu specify panrom.

Innum mukkiyamaana vishayam — continuity.

First shot-la city blue lighting-la irundhaa, next shot-la reason illaama colour, buildings, location ellam change aagakoodaadhu. Adhanala consistency requirements-um include panrom.

Ippo output-la final video prompt mattum illaama, shot-by-shot timeline-um varudhu.

[SHOW THE GENERATED PROMPT, THEN THE VIDEO GENERATOR RESULT.]

Result perfect-aa irukkum-nu guarantee illa. Generated video-la camera movement unnatural-aa irukkalaam, objects distort aagalaam, continuity break aagalaam.

Adhanala prompt-oda kooda quality checklist kekkanum. Generate pannitu inspect pannanum.

Animation-ku takeaway: visual adjectives mattum sollaadheenga. Subject, action, camera, lighting, duration, continuity ellam describe pannunga.

### 03:10–05:20 — Demo 2: Proper research

Next, research.

Namma “Research AI tools in 2026” nu AI-kitta kettaa, oru long answer kidaikkalaam.

Aana andha tools current-aa irukka? Pricing correct-aa? Source actually andha claim-a support pannudha? Idha eppadi therinjukkaradhu?

Research prompt-la first, question specific-aa irukkanum.

Second, time period specify pannanum.

Third, source requirements kudukkanum.

Fourth, conflicting evidence and limitations-um kekkanum.

[SCREEN RECORDING: Run the research prompt.]

Ippo output-la claim, source, publication date, evidence, limitations-nu table kekkirom.

Adhu mattum illa — direct source link-um venum.

[OPEN TWO SOURCES AND COMPARE THEM WITH THE AI'S CLAIMS.]

Oru source link irukkaradhu mattum proof illa. Source open panni, adhu namma claim-a actually support pannudha-nu check pannanum.

AI browse panna mudiyala-na, current research pannina maadhiri pretend panna koodaadhu. Andha limitation-a clearly sollanum.

Research-ku takeaway: summary mattum kekkaadheenga. Evidence, date, uncertainty, and verification-um kekkunga.

### 05:20–07:40 — Demo 3: Competitive analysis

Ippo useful-aana business example.

Suppose namma oru AI education brand start panrom. Market-la already pala academies irukku.

Namma “Analyse our competitors” nu type panninaa, generic strengths and weaknesses list kidaikkalaam.

Aana business decision edukka adhu mattum podhaadhu.

First, market specify pannanum. Geography, target customer, namma offer, business objective — idhellaam kudukkanum.

Next, competitors-a compare panna criteria specify pannanum.

Pricing, course structure, target audience, positioning, publicly visible marketing channels, customer feedback themes, and market gaps.

[SCREEN RECORDING: Open actual competitor websites and public pricing pages. Enter the research prompt.]

Inga oru important difference irukku.

Public website-la course price irundhaa, adha verify pannalaam. Aana competitor-oda actual revenue, conversion rate, private ad performance namakku theriyadhu.

Adha AI invent panna allow panna koodaadhu.

So, verified fact, inference, unknown — indha moonaiyum separate panna sollrom.

Finally, “competitors enna panraanga?” nu mattum illaama, “Namma enna test pannalaam?”-num kekkirom.

For example, oru competitor free workshop conduct panraanga-na, namma adhe strategy copy panna vendiya avasiyam illa. Audience-ku workshop useful-aa irukka? Enna evidence irukku? Namma audience-kitta oru small experiment panni validate panna mudiyuma? Nu yosikkanum.

Competitive analysis-ku takeaway: competitor list create pannradhu goal illa. Evidence-based business decision edukkaradhu dhaan goal.

### 07:40–09:45 — Demo 4: Better YouTube and Instagram scripts

Next, content creation.

“Write a viral Instagram Reel” nu AI-kitta sonnaa, generic hook, generic tips, generic CTA varalaam.

Adhukku badhila, namma audience yaaru, avanga enna problem face panraanga, video-la enna demonstrate panna mudiyum, duration evlo, language enna-nu specify pannuvom.

Inga innoru powerful tip: reference examples kudunga.

High-performing videos-a research pannitu, avanga script-a copy panna sollaadheenga. Adhula observable patterns-a analyse panna sollunga.

For example, opening-la problem kaatturaangala? Actual demo irukka? Output comparison irukka? End-la useful takeaway irukka?

[SHOW TWO OR THREE REFERENCE EXAMPLES AND A SHORT PATTERN ANALYSIS.]

Next, script-a one shot-la final panna vendam.

First, audience problem and unique angle.

Second, three hooks.

Third, outline.

Fourth, full script with visual directions.

Fifth, repetition and factual claims check.

Idhu staged workflow. Oru prompt-la ellathaiyum force pannradha vida, complex task-ku separate stages useful-aa irukkalaam.

[SHOW THE SCRIPT AND THE SCREEN-RECORDING PLAN.]

Innum mukkiyamaana vishayam — script natural-aa pesura maadhiri irukkanum. Written essay maadhiri irundhaa, adha aloud read panni awkward lines-a rewrite pannunga.

Content-ku takeaway: “Write a viral script” nu mattum sollaadheenga. Audience, evidence, hook, demonstration, pacing, visuals, and runtime specify pannunga.

### 09:45–10:45 — The reusable prompt framework

Ippo naalu demos-la irundhu oru common method edukkalaam.

Goal — enna result venum?

Context — AI enna therinjukkanum?

Audience — yaarukkaaga create panrom?

Constraints — enna include pannanum, enna avoid pannanum?

Output — final result eppadi venum?

Verification — result-a eppadi check pannanum?

Indha six elements useful starting point. Aana simple question-ku full template thevai illa.

Complex research, coding, business strategy, animation maadhiri tasks-ku detailed instructions useful-aa irukkum.

### 10:45–11:30 — Three mistakes to avoid

First, role mattum kuduthu stop pannadheenga. Actual task and constraints-um specify pannunga.

Second, longer prompt-na better answer-nu assume pannadheenga. Relevant information dhaan mukkiyam.

Third, AI output-a final truth-nu accept pannadheenga. Research-na source verify pannunga; code-na run pannunga; animation-na inspect pannunga; business analysis-na facts and assumptions-a separate pannunga.

### 11:30–12:00 — Closing

Innaikku neenga oru useful lesson learn panniruppeenga-nu namburen.

AI-kitta just answer kekkaradha vida, useful result create panna clear direction kudunga. Adhukku apram result-a evaluate pannunga.

Animation, research, competitor analysis, scriptwriting — naalu copy-paste prompts-um resource pack-la irukkum.

Video-va save pannunga, oru prompt-a unga own task-ku apply pannunga, result enna difference create pannudhu-nu test pannunga.




